## English

The first public standalone **e4steam Friends** client addon release for Minecraft 26.2.


### Features

- native Steam friends screen matching Minecraft 26.2's Friends UI language;
- Steam friends, full avatars, and presence states;
- Minecraft/e4steam detection and game-version display;
- search by Steam persona or Minecraft username;
- all-Steam-friends and Minecraft-player filtering;
- invite, join, and request-to-join actions;
- background invitation and request notifications;
- complete Russian and English localization;
- Steam Overlay invitations and short e4steam addresses remain available.

The addon references sprites bundled with the installed game and does not redistribute Mojang artwork.

### Compatibility

- Minecraft 26.2;
- Java 25;
- Fabric Loader 0.19.3+ with Fabric API 0.156.0+26.2;
- NeoForge 26.2.0.64+;
- e4steam 0.3.0 development build.

### Verification

- full `clean check build` completed;
- all 9 unit tests passed;
- independent Fabric and NeoForge artifact audits passed;
- Fabric behavior was confirmed in game by the project owner;
- the NeoForge development client reached the title screen without an addon error.

Final-JAR screen interaction and two-real-account Steam flows on NeoForge still require manual verification.

### Files

- `e4steam-friends-fabric-mc26.2-0.1.0.jar`;
- `e4steam-friends-neoforge-mc26.2-0.1.0.jar`.

